WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
March 1st (Tuesday)

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:19.680
An unbelievable sight
spreads in front of our eyes!

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:23.850
It's been about three or four hours
since the first body's been found!

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:27.190
The scene is in an uproar
with even more investigators!

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:31.110
The birds-eye view of Inokashira Lake
is enveloped in a strange feeling of sorts!

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:35.160
Even now, in various places, bodies are being
pulled out of the water by the investigators!

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:34.070
POLICE

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.910
There are many bodies that seem
to be of women and children, as well!

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:40.500
There is no other way
to put this than... a nightmare!

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.500
MITAKA CITY MASS SUICIDE
70 BODIES FOUND SO FAR
IN INOKASHIRA PARK

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.420
Is it okay to show corpses?

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:46.750
I don't think so.

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:50.960
Sorry, I'm late!

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:54.510
But then, an emergency meeting
from this early in the morning—

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:55.890
Huh?

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:00.020
Good morning.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:05.060
Makabe, the meeting hasn't started yet?

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:08.060
Hey, Makabe...

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:11.690
MITAKA CITY MASS SUICIDE
70 BODIES FOUND SO FAR

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:12.690
Seventy?

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:14.240
<i>We have new information!</i>

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:18.830
<i>According to the police report, the number
of corpses found has passed 100 now!</i>

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:19.700
Ascension...

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:23.040
<i>There are quite a few corpses
still sunk in the lake,</i>

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:26.210
<i>and the possibility that the total casualties
will top 200 is said to be high!</i>

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:28.590
<i>The process of pulling them up
is making slow progress,</i>

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:31.460
<i>and they have not yet been able
to identify any of the bodies!</i>

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:33.050
<i>Look at that!</i>

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:36.180
<i>A power shovel is trying
to pull something out of the water!</i>

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:39.140
Idiots! Don't thrash about the scene
any more than this!

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:42.430
A clue to figuring out the mystery
of the crime might still be there!

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:43.430
Jeez...

00:01:44.390 --> 00:01:45.980
What in the world happened?

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:48.360
Why are there so many corpses...

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:52.650
Editor-in-chief,
is this an occultic phenomenon?

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:58.450
<i>I saw it! I saw it with my own eyes!</i>

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:00.950
<i>I saw all the people going into the lake!</i>

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:02.330
<i>Please give us the details!</i>

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:06.580
<i>There aren't any details! They all went
into the lake as if they were going on a walk!</i>

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:09.170
<i>It sure felt eerie, I tell you!</i>

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:13.550
Editor-in-chief, is it too easy to think of this
along the lines of mass hypnosis?

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:15.670
In any case...

00:02:15.970 --> 00:02:17.880
this is a catastrophic situation!

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:20.550
Hey, Hirata!
Take a few with you and go to Kichijoji!

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:23.180
S-Sure! Ishikawa, get the camera ready!

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:24.430
Got it!

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:29.770
Are we going to follow
this story on Mumu?

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:33.650
We're not a gossip magazine.
But we're still going to follow this story?

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:36.360
If we don't get moving,
we can't figure anything out.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.490
Should we go look for the woman
who was giving her statement on the news?

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:41.280
Hey!

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:43.870
For now, Sumikaze... just go look!

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:44.660
- Sure!
- Sure!

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:23.010
March 2nd (Wednesday)

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:26.300
On the 1st of this month,

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:30.770
concerning the case where a massive number
of corpses were found from a lake

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:33.060
within Inokashira Park
in Mitaka City, Tokyo,

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:35.730
the Musashino Police Station
of the Metropolitan Police Department

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:40.240
finished searching for the bodies
in the evening of the 2nd.

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:46.530
They announced
that the final body count was 256.

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:49.240
They're going ahead right now
with identification of the victims,

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:51.540
but only 34 have been
identified to present.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:53.710
The cause of death
for most of the 256 is drowning,

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:56.290
Inokashira Park's body count to 256,
cancelling investigation

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:56.290
and no bodies were found
with external wounds.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.040
Huh?

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.040
NEET God

00:04:57.340 --> 00:05:00.170
No foul play?
Are they saying this as a gag?

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:02.300
This announcement goes
way out of left field!

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:05.640
The media is trying to guide public opinion
into the mass hypnosis theory!

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:09.010
Ino-Ino-kashira, Inokashira!

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:07.100
What are they gonna do
about this? There.

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:10.350
A mass suicide case in Inokashira Park...

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:13.350
It's not Inogashira, it's Inokashira!

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:12.480
This is the perfect case for Kiri Kiri Basara!

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:14.940
It's like telling us
to make money off of affiliates!

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:21.570
It's not the god of stomachs,
it's Inokashira!

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:19.320
I'm sure the number of site views
will skyrocket with this!

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:21.570
I'm glad I live in Kichijoji.

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:23.820
From here, this is my turn...
the turn of NEET God!

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:24.030
Twirl, twirl, twirl!

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:26.070
At this rate, I'll make enough
to treat Ryo-tas to Woodbusters!

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:33.870
Wait, wait... Why are you
watching from so far away?

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:35.750
I'm totally just turned off by all of it!

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:40.800
The manager aside, Ryo-tas
and Myu-pom are both Basara Girls,

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.300
so you should help me out a bit more!

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:45.010
More like Gamo-senpai...
You're totally full of energy again.

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:49.800
Right. Gamota not showing up at my place
is something that's never happened before.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:54.020
C-Can it be
that y-you're worried about me?

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:57.560
Right. Well, I guess so.

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:02.320
The Myu-pom is worrying about me!
I'm so glad I've been the NEET God!

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:04.030
But, Gamo-senpai...

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:06.910
I don't think it's good
to poke fun about this case.

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:12.040
No, but, Kiri Kiri Basara has always taken
this stance of operation until now.

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:14.040
B-Besides, don't you think it's strange?

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:16.870
I mean, on TV and on the internet,
everyone is like occult this, occult that!

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:19.460
They're making a big deal!
Isn't it a bit too unnatural?

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:23.420
I don't think you can help that, right?
The occult is booming lately after all.

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:24.800
Inokashira Park's Mass Death Investigation to End

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:27.550
Besides, Gamota, you're a lot happier
if the occult is booming, right?

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:33.260
Of course, but it's obvious that this is staged
by the media and those above them!

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:37.480
Mass Drowning, Investigation to End

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:35.680
In other words, the government!

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:37.640
It's the same as the fashion industry!

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:42.900
Gamotan is very very spirited today,
more than usual!

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:45.070
One and a half times? Twofold? Tenfold?

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:46.440
Hundredfold!

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:48.570
Fo-fo-fold!

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:50.450
In any case, you shouldn't believe
in what everyone is saying

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:52.120
on the media and the internet.

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:56.290
Even I'm not planning on believing
in curses or the doings of ghosts, but...

00:06:56.290 --> 00:07:00.670
In the first place, they don't really
understand how 256 people died off, right?

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:02.340
You weren't watching TV?

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:05.090
The lady that claimed to be
the eyewitness was talking.

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:09.090
No, everyone is unconditionally taking her
story hook, line and sinker a bit too much.

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:13.390
She can merely be someone that's using
this opportunity to become famous, right?

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:17.060
So the mass hypnosis
by a religious cult theory is bad, too?

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:19.190
Well, I think mass hypnosis
is a well-balanced theory

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:22.480
that goes right in between
the occult and reality.

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:24.440
You sound so lofty with every word.

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:25.230
You're cute in a gross way!

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:25.780
I am the NEET God!

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:29.990
Then, Gamo-senpai, what do you think
is the truth behind this case?

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:32.490
I don't think it was mass hypnosis.

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:33.780
This is...

00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:35.740
mass suicide!

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:38.910
What's different about that
compared to mass hypnosis?

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:41.830
It just means there wasn't anyone
who hypnotized any of them.

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:46.090
So-called conspiracy theories of that sort are,
in reality, just fighting invisible enemies.

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:50.180
The logic behind that is just
being scared of being cursed by ghosts.

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:52.090
Too many people are not realizing this.

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:53.550
I mean, isn't it incomprehensible?

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:56.640
Let's say someone mass hypnotized them
and made them commit suicide!

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:59.930
What does that guy gain?
Is there anything? There isn't, right?

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:01.640
Gamo-senpai, calm down.

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:03.520
Gamota, you're so gross!

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:06.150
I'll toss those words right back to you!

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:09.690
The truth behind the case is precisely...

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:12.200
an offline meeting
of suicide volunteers at Kichijoji!

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:15.160
The recruitment header is like this...

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:17.290
"Let's have an offline meeting
with only suicide volunteers attending!

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:19.790
After having a blast with everyone else
harboring the same feelings you have,

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:21.370
let's all commit suicide
in the same place!

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:24.790
That way, you can adorn the end of your life
with a news that shakes Japan!"

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:26.670
How imprudent, Gamota!

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:29.170
So close! The manager is so close!

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:30.420
So...

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:32.680
So, what after that?

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:34.010
After that...

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:37.720
With the numbers being what it is,
there might be a commotion.

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:40.770
So, they split up into groups and headed
to their deaths a few people at a time.

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:43.560
It wouldn't be strange to have staff
that help form the lines and stuff.

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:45.190
In other words, it's an event.

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:47.900
Can people stay that calm
right before committing suicide?

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:50.190
By fellow suicide volunteers
gathering around,

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:52.610
some kind of an atmosphere
would be created, right?

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:55.160
It makes you think you can die
if you're together with these guys.

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:58.490
Japanese society is one that you have to
take hints from the atmosphere.

00:08:58.490 --> 00:09:00.410
So they take the hint and die.

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:03.540
Nice and cynical there.

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:06.710
In any case,
there's no conspiracy theory!

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:08.170
Everyone is fighting an invisible enemy,

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:11.630
and they want to bask in the pleasures
of their deduction being the correct one!

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:13.050
It can't be that Chi, too...

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:15.090
Gamonosuke!

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:15.840
Ryo-tas!

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:18.560
The samurai,
Gamonosuke Hikojuro Gorozaemon...

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:19.220
Wh-What?

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:23.100
How do you know there aren't
any hidden enemies out there?

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:24.600
<i>You're going to pull out his tooth!</i>

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:33.990
<i>Right now, you can get away!
Get out into the hallway!</i>

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:39.700
<i>What if the real culprit had noticed me?</i>

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:44.500
<i>What if they thought about killing everyone
at Seimei Academy in order to hide the crime?</i>

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:48.040
<i>What if it's proven that those involved in the
mass suicide are affiliated with the academy?</i>

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:49.040
Gamotan?

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:52.210
You are acting strange,
Gamonosuke-samurai!

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:54.420
N-No, I'm fine.

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:58.090
I-I know! There's someone
I'd like to introduce you to!

00:09:58.090 --> 00:10:00.850
Well, I'm not sure if it's a person,
but oh well, just take a look at this!

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:04.600
Actually, this radio talks
to me in a girl's voice!

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:06.690
Hey, Zonko? You there?
I know you're there.

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:08.810
I'm sorry, but can you
introduce yourself to everyone?

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:14.900
Zonko-tan? Are you alive?

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:16.070
It's Ryo-tas!

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:18.030
Poyaya!

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:40.800
KIRYU KUSAKABE

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:40.800
<i>Do you know what kind of a place
the world of the dead is?</i>

00:10:41.010 --> 00:10:43.430
<i>It seems like charismatic psychics
and pompous scholars</i>

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:47.480
<i>cook up random stories
and create convenient world views.</i>

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:50.020
<i>But of course,
things of that nature are all lies.</i>

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:54.150
<i>Most humans who live proper lives
don't know of the afterlife.</i>

00:10:54.360 --> 00:10:56.650
<i>However, I know of that afterlife.</i>

00:10:56.650 --> 00:10:57.900
<i>How do I know?</i>

00:10:58.200 --> 00:10:59.780
<i>That goes without explanation.</i>

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:02.530
<i>Because I have, time and time again...</i>

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:05.080
<i>have died.</i>

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:14.500
<i>I met that girl</i>

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:18.800
<i>when I was wandering after I died.</i>

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:31.810
<i>Big Brother...</i>

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:39.490
<i>Just like this... I want to head
where you are, Big Brother.</i>

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:43.160
<i>Where you are, Big Brother!</i>

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:48.330
<i>Where you are, Big Brother!</i>

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:54.500
<i>You still don't have that privilege yet.</i>

00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:08.640
<i>If I watched a woman turn to mincemeat,
my conscience wouldn't be at ease.</i>

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:11.480
<i>So I couldn't help but to reach out
to her within her heart.</i>

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:14.020
<i>But to think she'd actually
hear my voice...</i>

00:12:14.270 --> 00:12:16.440
<i>Nothing less from a ghost,
is what I thought.</i>

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:19.780
<i>Big Brother? Big Brother, is that you?</i>

00:12:19.780 --> 00:12:23.910
<i>It's you, isn't it, Big Brother?
Where are you? Please show me yourself!</i>

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:24.660
<i>Nope.</i>

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:27.490
<i>I ain't your big brother or anything.</i>

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:31.330
<i>I'm hearing another hallucination.</i>

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:32.540
<i>It's not a hallucination.</i>

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:35.130
<i>Don't go off making me a part of you.</i>

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:37.880
<i>I exist as myself.</i>

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:42.930
<i>Then...</i>

00:12:43.550 --> 00:12:45.350
<i>Then, you are...</i>

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:48.930
<i>...a devil...</i>

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:50.600
<i>right?</i>

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:53.770
<i>Yeah, that's right.</i>

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:58.650
<i>Just as I thought...</i>

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:00.360
<i>Just for me...</i>

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:04.110
<i>My devil...</i>

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:15.380
<i>What a masterpiece!
That insane girl mistook me for a devil.</i>

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.340
<i>Well, it's been a bit more
than two years since that day.</i>

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:20.170
<i>I'm getting accustomed
to the black magic agent business</i>

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:21.670
<i>we started from her suggestion.</i>

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:22.970
<i>After all, I am...</i>

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:26.220
<i>a real devil.</i>

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:36.270
<i>You shouldn't look at the dial.</i>

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:38.480
<i>You can't trust your ears either.</i>

00:13:38.820 --> 00:13:40.530
<i>You have only your hands to feel it all.</i>

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:45.700
I'm so tired today.

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:50.580
I tried to act as I normally do,
but I wonder if they're suspicious of me.

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:53.160
<i>If I were to pass away someday,</i>

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:56.460
<i>I'll become a ghost DJ
and reach out to talk to you.</i>

00:13:57.210 --> 00:13:58.080
Dad...

00:13:58.670 --> 00:14:00.210
<i>Are you an idiot?</i>

00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:04.970
Wh-What was that all of a sudden?
You were so quiet earlier!

00:14:04.970 --> 00:14:06.970
- Of course I'm going to stay silent!
- Why?

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:09.800
<i>What are you doing,
revealing my existence to other people?</i>

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:13.980
<i>If a high school guy says, "I hear voices
of a beautiful girl from the radio,"</i>

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:15.600
<i>someone will report to the police!</i>

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:16.270
Indeed.

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:18.020
<i>It's the end of you if they report you.</i>

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:20.480
<i>That other incident,
even if you're innocent,</i>

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:22.280
<i>they do have circumstantial evidence!</i>

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:29.280
Am I just going to be captured?

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:39.710
Isayuki Hashigami

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:53.770
<i>Hey, Zonko.</i>

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:56.270
POLICE INVESTIGATING
PROFESSOR HASHIGAMI'S MURDER

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:58.100
<i>I've been scared to look up that incident
on the internet for the past week...</i>

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:59.520
POLICE HIT THE ROCKS

00:14:58.400 --> 00:15:03.070
<i>I'm thinking, maybe there is information
out there saying "Yuta Gamon did it."</i>

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:06.360
<i>But I do want at least
a little information after all.</i>

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:07.570
Supernatural Science Kiri Kiri Basara

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:07.570
Huh?

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:10.820
Come to think of it,
I wrote about this quite a while ago.

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:14.700
University LOL
Professor LOLOLOL
Makes me laugh LMAO

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:20.920
It's not much information.

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.880
Domo, I'm Zenigata

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.880
It's about Hashigami's case.

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:28.090
I remember now
that there was a really similar situation

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:31.050
in an adult doujin for women
on sale at Winter Comiket last year.

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:34.720
The one by Ririka Nishizono
titled "A Dark Water's Bottom."

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:37.100
I wonder if it has
anything to do with the case?

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:38.690
Search Foogle for "A Dark Water's Bottom"

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:43.650
What is this?

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:44.940
Boys' Love, huh?

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:46.940
That's out of my league.

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:53.950
March 3rd (Thursday)

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:55.950
Thank you very much

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:57.620
for coming all the way out here.

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:01.170
It's fine, really. I had
some reporting to do in Kichijoji, too.

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:04.290
Touko, you're the only one
I can consult about things like this.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:07.090
You're still a kid,
so don't be afraid of troubling others.

00:16:07.340 --> 00:16:10.090
And so, have you talked
about this friend of yours to the police?

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:12.930
Her family said they've submitted
a missing persons request.

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:14.970
And has there been any progress?

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:16.930
- No, not really.
- I see.

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:20.310
Chi... where has she gone?

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:25.190
About the case at Inokashira Park...
When I think about it, I'm scared.

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:27.280
Because the timing was what it was...

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:30.780
I feel like perhaps Chi was in those masses!

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:33.320
Miyuu?

00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:36.450
Oh, I'm sorry. I'm fine.

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:39.660
I just remembered a dream
I've been having lately.

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:51.590
Actually, the reporting
I was doing today was about that case.

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:57.310
The victims of that case...
Only about half have been identified so far.

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:02.690
Touko...

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:06.560
Do people really die that easily?

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:11.950
Touko, do you think there's an afterlife?

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:16.030
Yes, of course there is one.

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:21.120
When I deny the existence of an afterlife,

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:23.460
I suddenly feel
like this world is very cramped.

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:26.210
Well, to be honest,

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:31.130
it's bogus to make readers believe stories
you don't believe in yourself, right?

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:32.760
Indeed.

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:40.680
Touko, I wonder what Gamo-senpai
would say if he heard your story.

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:41.890
Gamo?

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:44.350
He's the senpai
that's looking after me lately.

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:47.440
He runs a round-up website
called Kiri Kiri Basara.

00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:47.440
Miyuu!

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:49.270
You know the site owner
of Kiri Kiri Basara?

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:50.440
Yes.

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:52.190
Please, introduce me to him sometime!

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:53.820
Actually, I think
there might be some relationship

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:56.070
between the site and a case
I'm going after!

00:17:56.070 --> 00:17:58.120
Did Gamo-senpai do something wrong?

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:00.950
Oh, no, it's nothing like that.

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:06.460
But I feel like valuable information of sorts
is gathering at that website Kiri Kiri Basara.

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:08.420
Perhaps!

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:11.710
Private Number

00:18:14.050 --> 00:18:16.090
Hello? Chi? Where have you gone?

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:20.100
And with those presumptions,
as the NEET God,

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:24.060
I'm pushing for the mass suicide meeting
theory instead of mass hypnosis.

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:26.100
All you Basarars out there,
what do you think? There.

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:31.190
I uploaded a great article
for the first time in a while!

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:33.820
More like, I usually don't write up
my own feelings into articles,

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:33.280
Inokashira Park Incident

00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:35.320
I think!
Mass suicide offline meeting!

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:35.320
so it's a bit embarrassing.

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:37.990
But maybe I'm kinda
like an intellectual now?

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:43.870
Intellectual, Martian, Guatemalan!

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:41.660
Poya-gun, no!

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:44.500
Hey, can you keep it quiet?

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:49.500
Why did Gamotan turn his
"amazing setting" into an article this time?

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:54.130
Oh, Ryo-tas, you're going to ask that?
You're going to ask me that?

00:18:54.130 --> 00:18:55.050
I'm going to ask!

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:57.880
Ryo-tas! Hold it!
That's dangerous! No Poya-gun!

00:18:57.880 --> 00:18:58.800
Poya...

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:02.680
I took the effort to make
my own opinion into an article because...

00:19:02.680 --> 00:19:03.390
Because?

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:06.350
It's an alarm
against the recent public opinion.

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:07.730
Alarm?

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:11.440
Basically a warning!
Everyone is dancing to the occult boom!

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:15.400
Seriously, the really bad parts
of Japanese society are showing up!

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:16.950
The pressure to synchronize, so to say?

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:18.410
You're one to say that, Gamota?

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:20.620
You run an occult website!

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:24.330
It's true that I'm the owner of a round-up
website for occult information,

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:26.620
but that's merely
to make money from affiliates.

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:29.330
It doesn't have to be the occult,
if it makes me money!

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:32.630
But while you're at it, it's better for you
if the occult is booming, right?

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:34.380
Because more people
will show interest that way.

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:37.130
KiriBasa is a den for anti-occultists.

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:38.970
I'm happy that they get
all worked up about this,

00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:40.890
but the round-up site is to laugh off
the information illiterates

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:44.350
who believe it's the occult, and refute
everything to clear it all off your chest!

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:46.430
Well, if the occult is a fad,
the discussions become more heated up,

00:19:46.430 --> 00:19:51.310
and more people access the website,
so I totally welcome that!

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:54.980
H-Hold on! What? Ryo-tas! Stop!

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:54.980
Advocate! Advocate! Advocate!

00:19:54.980 --> 00:19:56.480
Don't poke! What's an advocate?

00:19:54.980 --> 00:19:56.480
Devil's advocate!

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:59.030
Gamotan is the devil's advocate!

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:00.320
Oh, sure.

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:04.160
But in any case, that incident
at Inokashira Park really is full of mystery.

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:07.120
The information from the TV
hasn't changed much either.

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:09.960
That means the police
don't understand it really well either.

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:14.250
Indeed. We don't know why the body
identifications are being delayed either.

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:19.260
Almost all victims have drowned,
and they were found in less than 24 hours!

00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:21.470
So there's almost no damage
to the bodies.

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:24.600
But still, not even half of the bodies
have been identified as of yet.

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:29.100
I'm scared! What if I get sucked
into that lake, as well!

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:33.610
What to do, what to do,
wait for me, Boss!

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:33.610
<i>The fact that Professor Hashigami
was murdered</i>

00:20:33.610 --> 00:20:36.150
<i>has long been forgotten
by the public now.</i>

00:20:36.570 --> 00:20:39.400
<i>If the police have their hands full
with the case at Inokashira Park,</i>

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:43.160
<i>that shorthands the investigation
for Professor Hashigami's murder.</i>

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:50.910
Jeez, Ryo-tas dances her dances,

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:54.330
but doesn't help me at all!

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:57.670
Really, can we still call her
a Basara Girl like this?

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:09.140
Dammit. Go in. Please go in.

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:18.320
How long do I have to
continue something like this?

00:21:19.150 --> 00:21:22.860
Why... Why did it end up like this?

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:27.080
Hey.

00:21:54.020 --> 00:21:57.690
To think that there's a sanctuary
in the middle of a city like this...

00:21:57.690 --> 00:21:59.400
Don't you think that's absurd?

00:21:59.650 --> 00:22:01.820
Let's make the huge assumption
that there is a god.

00:22:01.820 --> 00:22:06.070
Do you think he'd settle down to live
in such a loud place with lots of traffic?

00:22:06.360 --> 00:22:07.120
Answer me!

00:22:10.540 --> 00:22:11.540
Why?

00:22:11.870 --> 00:22:13.540
Why Kiri Kiri Basara?

00:23:51.890 --> 00:23:52.640
This program is a work of fiction.
Any resemblance to people, parties,
or situations is purely coincidental.
